            "text": "Utilization note: Per Acme Health Plan Policy SURG-029, \"Prior Authorization Criteria,\" Section 3 states: \"The conservative- therapy requirement is waived when mechanical symptoms with a positive McMurray test are documented.\" Criterion 3 is therefore satisfied without additional conservative-therapy documentation; see policy quote above.\n"
